{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1023144-attainments-granting-influence","id":1023144,"title":"Attainments granting Influence","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-28T00:25:56-08:00","id":1023144,"title":"Attainments granting Influence","content":"In the Summoners book there is the Katsinam Suukya Legacy that can give mages Influence of their choosing. I am interested in taking this concept further, as an alternative for more mages to gain power in another domain without having to buy appropriate Arcana, create fetishes or work through spirits / ghosts / goetia.<br /> <br /> \u200bThe idea is that the Mage at their Attainment consorts with some ephemeral being in some way and thereafter gain a dot of Influence for each Attainment dot instead of a reworked spell, almost like how Werewolves gain Gifts. For example a Thyrsus bonding with a trickster Spirit as part of their Legacy could gain Influence: Lies and thereby gain some limited ability to affect the minds of others, create illusions and so on without having to invest in an expensive Inferior Arcanum.<br /> \u200b<br /> \u200bImagine that this would allow for some interesting and colourful variations of Mages.<br /> <br /> \u200bHas anyone thought about this or even tried it in their games?<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, if I did implement this, would it only be limited to Arcana that deals a lot with Ephemeral beings, such as Spirit and Death?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-28T01:57:31-08:00","id":1023158,"title":"","content":"You don't need it as an attainment though, just Pact for it and then you'd also have the versatility of swapping Influences instead of it being locked in as an attainment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 12-29-2016, 01:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-29T09:54:47-08:00","id":1023829,"title":"","content":"Where can I read more about these Pacts? Is it in the Mage: the Awakening Core book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-29T10:11:05-08:00","id":1023838,"title":"","content":"It's in the Summoners book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-29T10:29:53-08:00","id":1023844,"title":"","content":"Page 128 and pages 171-182. There may be additional stuff in the books but that would be a good place to start.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T11:01:39-08:00","id":1026051,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the hints and information!<br /> <br /> I have skimmed through the pages suggested but the pacts in there all entail some sort of sacrifice or serious cost. My idea of gaining Influence (or maybe even Numina for that matter) with Attainment dots would mean that the mage does so on her own terms and without really sacrificing something other than the trials, avails and ordeals of entering a legacy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T11:12:26-08:00","id":1026058,"title":"","content":"Yeah, they all have a cost, but if you're smart then you make small deals with low costs as frequently as possible in order to get use out of a creature(s)'s power as possible with little to no detriment to you.<br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure it's also possible to make a deal go better for you than for the entity you're bargaining with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T12:58:43-08:00","id":1026126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1023144-attainments-granting-influence?p=1026058#post1026058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, they all have a cost, but if you're smart then you make small deals with low costs as frequently as possible in order to get use out of a creature(s)'s power as possible with little to no detriment to you.<br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure it's also possible to make a deal go better for you than for the entity you're bargaining with.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bTraumatic memories of dealing with Devils in D&amp;D makes me definitely think otherwise, kind of depends on how lenient or punishing the Storyteller is.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T14:57:04-08:00","id":1026176,"title":"","content":"If you see the way the system is balanced it's unlikely to be much of an issue of abuse by ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}